sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant Security as security-service
    participant Target as Service cible

    Admin->>Frontend: Lancer une action sensible
    Frontend->>Auth: Verifier la session admin
    Auth-->>Frontend: Session valide
    Frontend->>AdminService: Envoyer la demande
    AdminService->>Security: Demander une verification
    Security->>Security: Evaluer les droits et le risque

    alt Action autorisee
        Security-->>AdminService: Autorisation accordee
        AdminService->>Target: Executer l'action
        Target-->>AdminService: Resultat de l'operation
        AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner le succes
        Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher la confirmation
    else Action refusee
        Security-->>AdminService: Refus / restriction
        AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner un message de blocage
        Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher l'erreur de securite
    end
